                                "sense_id": "f75e0ac0-fea8-3765-a36f-c14ee63ce6d4",
                                "text": "As for Bodhidharma the only painting extant is too late to have been done from life. The sage’s eyes are crossed from his exertions. Diplopia giving the impression of the pineal eye, the Third Eye in full flower."
                            },
                            {
